# 🚀 API Cheatsheet - Comandos Rápidos

Copie e cole os comandos mais usados!

---

## ⚡ Variables (customize aqui)
@host = http://localhost
@contentType = application/json
@accept = application/json

# Atualize estes IDs após criar recursos
@teamId = 1
@playerId = 1
@championshipId = 1
@fixtureId = 1

---

## 🔍 READ Operations (GET)

### Health Check
GET {{host}}/api/utils/check

### List Teams
GET {{host}}/api/team/

### List Players
GET {{host}}/api/player

### Team Detail
GET {{host}}/api/team/{{teamId}}/detail

### Team Players
GET {{host}}/api/team/{{teamId}}/current

### Player Detail
GET {{host}}/api/player/{{playerId}}

### Championship Detail
GET {{host}}/api/championship/{{championshipId}}

### Championship Fixtures
GET {{host}}/api/championship/{{championshipId}}/fixtures

### Unplayed Fixtures
GET {{host}}/api/fixtures/{{championshipId}}/unplayed

### Standings
GET {{host}}/api/championship/standings/{{championshipId}}

### Players Stats
GET {{host}}/api/championship/players-stats/{{championshipId}}

### Team Stats
GET {{host}}/api/championship/team-stats/{{championshipId}}

### Players Analytics
GET {{host}}/api/players/analytic

### Championship Awards
GET {{host}}/api/championship/{{championshipId}}/awards

---

## ✍️ CREATE Operations (POST)

### Create Team
POST {{host}}/api/team
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Nome do Time",
  "logo": "logo.png",
  "founded": "2020-01-01",
  "stadium": "Nome do Estádio"
}

### Create Player
POST {{host}}/api/player
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Nome do Jogador",
  "position": "Atacante",
  "number": 10,
  "birth_date": "1995-05-15",
  "team_id": 1
}

### Create Championship
POST {{host}}/api/championship
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Nome do Campeonato",
  "season": "2024",
  "start_date": "2024-04-01",
  "end_date": "2024-12-15",
  "teams": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

---

## 🔄 UPDATE Operations (PUT)

### Update Team
PUT {{host}}/api/team/{{teamId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Nome Atualizado"
}

### Update Championship
PUT {{host}}/api/championship/{{championshipId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Nome Atualizado"
}

### Change Player Team
PUT {{host}}/api/player/change-team
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "player_id": 1,
  "new_team_id": 2,
  "transfer_date": "2024-01-15"
}

### Play Match
PUT {{host}}/api/fixtures/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fixture_id": 1,
  "home_score": 2,
  "away_score": 1,
  "played_at": "2024-05-15 20:00:00",
  "goals": [
    {"scorer_id": 1, "assist_id": 2, "minute": 15, "pk": false},
    {"scorer_id": 1, "assist_id": null, "minute": 45, "pk": true},
    {"scorer_id": 3, "assist_id": 4, "minute": 78, "pk": false}
  ]
}

---

## 🗑️ DELETE Operations (DELETE)

### Delete Team
DELETE {{host}}/api/team/{{teamId}}

### Delete Player
DELETE {{host}}/api/player/{{playerId}}

### Delete Championship
DELETE {{host}}/api/championship/{{championshipId}}

---

## 📊 ANALYTICS Operations

### Get Clashes
POST {{host}}/api/championship/clashes
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "team1_id": 1,
  "team2_id": 2,
  "championship_id": 1
}

### Table Data
GET {{host}}/api/championship/table-data/{{championshipId}}

---

## 🎯 Common Use Cases

### 1. Quick Test
GET {{host}}/api/utils/check

### 2. Create Full Team
# A) Create Team
POST {{host}}/api/team
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{"name": "Time Teste", "logo": "test.png", "founded": "2020-01-01", "stadium": "Estádio"}

# B) Add Players (repeat)
POST {{host}}/api/player
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{"name": "Jogador 1", "position": "Atacante", "number": 9, "birth_date": "1995-01-01", "team_id": 1}

### 3. Create & Start Championship
# A) Create Championship
POST {{host}}/api/championship
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{"name": "Campeonato 2024", "season": "2024", "start_date": "2024-04-01", "end_date": "2024-12-15", "teams": [1,2,3,4]}

# B) View Fixtures
GET {{host}}/api/championship/1/fixtures

# C) Play Match
PUT {{host}}/api/fixtures/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{"fixture_id": 1, "home_score": 2, "away_score": 1, "played_at": "2024-05-15 20:00:00", "goals": [{"scorer_id": 1, "assist_id": 2, "minute": 15, "pk": false}, {"scorer_id": 1, "assist_id": null, "minute": 45, "pk": true}, {"scorer_id": 3, "assist_id": 4, "minute": 78, "pk": false}]}

# D) View Standings
GET {{host}}/api/championship/standings/1

---

## 💡 Pro Tips

### Keyboard Shortcuts (VS Code + REST Client)
- `Ctrl+Alt+R` (Mac: `Cmd+Alt+R`) - Send Request
- `Ctrl+Alt+E` (Mac: `Cmd+Alt+E`) - Switch Environment
- `Ctrl+Alt+C` (Mac: `Cmd+Alt+C`) - Copy Response

### Quick Copy Templates

#### Minimal Team
```json
{"name": "Time X", "logo": "x.png", "founded": "2020-01-01", "stadium": "Estádio X"}
```

#### Minimal Player
```json
{"name": "Jogador X", "position": "Atacante", "number": 10, "birth_date": "1995-01-01", "team_id": 1}
```

#### Minimal Championship
```json
{"name": "Campeonato X", "season": "2024", "start_date": "2024-04-01", "end_date": "2024-12-15", "teams": [1,2,3,4]}
```

#### Minimal Match (0-0)
```json
{"fixture_id": 1, "home_score": 0, "away_score": 0, "played_at": "2024-05-15 20:00:00", "goals": []}
```

#### Goal Template
```json
{"scorer_id": 1, "assist_id": 2, "minute": 45, "pk": false}
```

---

## 🔧 Troubleshooting

### API Not Responding
GET {{host}}/api/utils/check

### Check Docker
```bash
docker-compose ps
docker-compose up -d
```

### View Logs
```bash
docker-compose logs -f
tail -f storage/logs/laravel.log
```

### Database Issues
```bash
docker-compose exec app php artisan migrate:fresh --seed
```

